        <mxCell id="note6" value="Rerun 2026-09-13 after two real, disclosed fixes: a hard block on overlapping-truck schedules and multi-hour-late chains (closes a correctness bug), then a real-data-grounded correction to the assumed earliest truck departure time (03:00, not 06:00 -- 7.6% of real historical pickups happen before 06:00). Full daily-level detail is in weekly_facet.png, monthly_facet.png, overall_summary.png (documents/results/dispatch_solver_backtest/) -- real matplotlib output from the actual 46-day run, not illustrative." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Trebuchet MS;align=center;fontColor=#666666;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
